%N A399044 Total number of connected components in all induced subgraphs of the n X n rook graph.
%H A399044 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A399044/b399044.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..50</a>
%H A399044 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/RookGraph.html">Rook Graph</a>.
